<div class="title">PROJECT SYNOPSIS</div>
<div class="subtitle">Real-Time AI Phishing Detection System Using Machine Learning and Full-Stack Flask Architecture</div>
<div class="meta">
  Submitted in partial fulfillment of the requirements for the Degree of<br>
  <strong>Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science & Engineering</strong><br><br>
  <strong>Domain:</strong> Cybersecurity / Machine Learning / Full-Stack Web Development<br>
