<h1>7. Expected Outcomes</h1>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Sub-50ms Evaluation:</strong> Real-time URL threat assessment suitable for active browser inspection and responsive web workflows[cite: 1].</li>
  <li><strong>Automated Batch Processing:</strong> High-throughput batch scanning module capable of evaluating hundreds of URLs concurrently from plain text or CSV uploads[cite: 1].</li>
  <li><strong>Persistent Security Audit Trail:</strong> Account-based database logging providing users with an itemized history of past scans and threat telemetry[cite: 1].</li>
  <li><strong>Zero-Day Threat Interception:</strong> Reliable classification of unlisted, freshly registered phishing URLs based strictly on statistical and lexical signatures[cite: 1].</li>
</ul>

